    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. Can you expand on that? Specifically, how should a nurse handle it when the patient's behavior transitions from just being loud or angry to something more unpredictable or \"erratic\"? I want to make sure the staff knows how to identify those sudden shifts in mood.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
